<ContentPage title="Shipping Policy" metaTitle="Shipping Policy | Konarkini Kids Clothing" description="Read Konarkini's current shipping status and future approach to dispatch and delivery for children's clothing orders." path="/shipping-policy/" eyebrow="Delivery information"><h2>Current shipping status</h2><p>Online ordering is not yet available and all products are currently out of stock, so no shipping services are being offered through this website.</p><h2>When ordering opens</h2><p>Before checkout is enabled, this page will be updated with available destinations, delivery estimates, shipping charges, dispatch timelines, tracking information, and procedures for delays.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>If you are interested in future availability, please contact us. We will never request payment through the website while products remain unavailable.</p></ContentPage>
